<section class="auth-card"><p class="eyebrow">StockChief Owner · mandatory MFA</p><h1><%= enrollment?'Set up your authenticator':'Enter your authenticator code' %></h1><p><%= email %></p><% if(enrollment){ %><p>Add an account in Microsoft Authenticator, Google Authenticator or your password manager. Choose a setup key and time-based codes.</p><label>Authenticator setup key<code class="setup-key"><%= secret %></code></label><p>This key is shown only during setup. Never share it. The console opens only after your first code is verified.</p><% } %><form method="post" action="/verify"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label>Six-digit authenticator code<input name="code" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{6}" maxlength="6" autocomplete="one-time-code" autofocus required></label><button class="primary"><%= enrollment?'Enable MFA and sign in':'Verify and sign in' %></button></form><a href="/login">Start sign-in again</a></section>
